# shadcn/ui skill (project)

This project has shadcn initialized (`components.json`) and the `shadcn` skill at `.cursor/skills/shadcn/` and `.agents/skills/shadcn/`.

When the user asks to add, search, fix, style, or compose shadcn/ui components — read and follow the `shadcn` skill. Use `npx shadcn@latest` (this repo uses npm, not pnpm).

Also installed: `migrate-radix-to-base` — only when migrating Radix components to Base UI.
